  <!-- EN: While most survivors of a crash try to adapt and coexist to the environment of the planet\nthey are on, your colonist utterly refuse to do so. With this research, colonists will be\nable to build a moisture converter to prepare synthesized energy drinks and bottle them\nin small canisters.\n\nUnlocks Building:\nMoisture Converter\n\nUnlocks food:\nElectrolytic Solution -->
  <AdRef_ResearchProjects_ARAdaptationRefusal.description>大多数坠机事故的幸存者都在努力适应和共存他们所在星球的环境，而你的殖民者却完全拒绝这样做。
但你们的殖民者却完全拒绝这样做。通过这项研究，殖民者将
就能制造出一种湿度转换器，用来制备合成能量饮料，并将其装入小罐子里。
装在小罐子里。

