  <!-- EN: AR - Algae-Kryll farming -->
  <AdRef_ResearchProjects_ARAlgaeFarming.label>AR - 藻类-蝼蛄养殖</AdRef_ResearchProjects_ARAlgaeFarming.label>
  <!-- EN: The colonists have noticed that even if synthetized energy drinks can sustain an individual\nfor some time, real food really is necessary. By adapting an abandoned Explorator-Korps technology they can build small bio-matter farms where Algae-Kryll (a modified krill)\ncan be grown and collected.\n\nUnlocks Building:\nAlgae-Kryll farms\n\nUnlocks food:\nAlgae-Kryll Goo -->
  <AdRef_ResearchProjects_ARAlgaeFarming.description>殖民者们注意到，即使合成能量饮料可以维持一个人一段时间的生命
但真正的食物确实很有必要。通过改造一项被遗弃的探索者-科尔普斯技术，他们可以建造小型生物物质农场，在那里种植和收集藻类-克里尔（一种改良磷虾）
可以在这里种植和收集。

解锁建筑：
藻类农场

解锁食物
Algae-Kryll Goo</AdRef_ResearchProjects_ARAlgaeFarming.description>
  <!-- EN: AR - Power Bacteria -->
  <AdRef_ResearchProjects_ARBioBatteries.label>AR - 动力细菌</AdRef_ResearchProjects_ARBioBatteries.label>
  <!-- EN: After gaining experience with the genetically modified Algae-Kryll, your colonists desire\nto push DNA tampering one step further. They will create an inedible bacteria strain that\ncan produce small quantities of electricity. Using a waterproof battery as a base structure\nand a good quantity of mineral-proteic compound they should be able to build a battery that will work for years.\n\nOne of you also suspects that it might be possible to use a small version of the bacteria battery to upgrade those crappy weapons you found in the escape pods.\n\nUnlocks Building:\nBacteria Battery\n\nUnlock Weapon Upgrading:\nPistols and Survival Rifles can be upgraded at the Large Bacteria Battery -->
  <AdRef_ResearchProjects_ARBioBatteries.description>在使用转基因藻类克里尔（Algae-Kryll）获得经验后，你们的殖民者希望
进一步篡改 DNA。他们将创造一种不可食用的细菌菌株，这种菌株可以
可以产生少量电力。使用防水电池作为基础结构
再加上大量的矿物保护化合物 他们就能制造出能工作数年的电池了

你们中还有人怀疑，也许可以用小型细菌电池来升级你们在逃生舱中找到的那些蹩脚武器。

解锁建筑：
细菌电池

解锁武器升级：
可在大型细菌电池升级手枪和生存步枪</AdRef_ResearchProjects_ARBioBatteries.description>
  <!-- EN: AR - OUR Rimworld -->
  <AdRef_ResearchProjects_AROurRimworld.label>AR - 我们的环游世界</AdRef_ResearchProjects_AROurRimworld.label>
  <!-- EN: Experience with bacteria batteries and energy weapons has led to unexpected results. "According to SCIENCE!" your colonists think they should be able to craft guns or even\ndesign new, advanced technologies. Afterall, in the dark alleys of the pirate merchant\nhomeworlds, "Back alley Workshops" are pretty common. On a Rimworld, it's legal too.\n\nUnlocks Building:\nBack Alley Workshop\n\nUnlock Weapon Crafting:\nProduces cheap and effective weapons\nHandcraft Advanced ones\n\nUnlock Armour Crafting:\nUnlocks recycling slag chunks into crude heavy armour -->
  <AdRef_ResearchProjects_AROurRimworld.description>细菌电池和能量武器的经验带来了意想不到的结果。"根据科学！"你的殖民者认为他们应该能够制造枪支，甚至
设计新的先进技术。毕竟，在海盗商
的暗巷里，"小作坊 "很常见。在边缘世界，这也是合法的。

